From 1a2bcb37376977bc4b93a09dd4ecf2ea62f7f5b5 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: lepirlouit <bdb@aloalto.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 14:33:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 1/3] arm: kirkwood: add Synology DS-212j board

Mainline port for the Synology DS-212j (88F6281 A1, 2x128 MB DDR2,
4 MB SPI NOR). DDR init values taken from the stock Synology U-Boot
1.1.4 kwbimage header. Uses the upstream kirkwood-ds212j DT, bootstd,
SATA (sata_mv), USB storage and SPI flash environment at 0x3D0000.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
